Revision history for Perl extension PerCUDA

{{$NEXT}}

    - Rebuild of the 2013 prototype for Perl 5.40+ and CUDA 12+
    - Translate kernels written in Perl to C and compile them to PTX with clang (NVPTX)
    - Run kernels on the GPU through CUDA::DriverAPI or in the perl interpreter
    - Cache compiled PTX
